MODULE 14: SUPER ADMIN PORTAL
HI-TECH College Integrated Digital Academic & Certification Platform

Next module – Platform Administration Web + Mobile + Desktop

The Super Admin Portal is the central control centre for managing the entire HI-TECH College platform. It provides institution-wide and system-wide configuration, governance, security, monitoring and administrative oversight.

The Super Admin controls how the platform operates, which modules are enabled, how institutions and campuses are configured, and how permissions are assigned.

Important security principle: Super Admin is a platform configuration role, not automatic permission to view every confidential record. Student counselling, medical information, private HR records, examination scripts and sensitive financial records must remain protected by separate permissions and approval workflows.

