001 — sequential number.

Rules:

A student number is generated only when an authorized registration workflow creates the official student record.

The number is unique within its configured institution, type and year sequence.

It cannot be edited by the student or ordinary portal users.

It must never be reassigned to another student.

The number must remain unchanged during transfers between classes or semesters within the same student identity.

Re-admission must link to the existing student record when policy requires it, not create an accidental duplicate.

Generation must be transaction-safe and protected against concurrent registration requests.

All registration number configuration and issuance must be auditable.

